# Vantage Admin Project Organization

`vantage-admin` is the Next.js 16 App Router owner/admin dashboard. Preserve ownership boundaries; put new work in the folder that owns the behavior.

**Dashboard redesign (2026-10-06):** seven sidebar destinations (Today `/` · Leads `/leads` · Bookings `/bookings` · Outreach Desk · Automations `/automations` (Owner) · Insights `/insights` · Setup `/setup`) in the app-wide CRM look (`app/crm.css`, `components/ui/crm/`, `[data-ui="crm"]` on the shell). Old routes redirect (`next.config.ts`). Delivery notes: `docs/dashboard-redesign/README.md`; server work owed: `docs/dashboard-redesign/SERVER-WORK.md`.

**Daily Operations (shipped):** Owner-only board, now the Operations tab of Today (`/?tab=operations`; `/daily` redirects, `/daily?lane=` to `&view=lanes&lane=`; a Manager may open it). **Doc 16 (2026-10-06):** two sub-views, `?view=board` (default: lane tiles + one tiered live feed) and `?view=lanes` (the seven lanes as row lists that expand in place; `?lane=` solo); every kind has a presentation tier (A spotlight card · B row · C counted; `presentationTier` in `lib/api/dailyOperationsBoard.ts`, viewer overrides in `localStorage` from the Colours & visibility panel; Quiet priorities is the B→C override of priority updates); the Arrivals rail and the seven card panels are gone; `DailyOperationsEventCard` survives only in the fact drawer and the expanded Lanes row; Outreach goal milestones (`outreach.rep_goal_met` / `outreach.team_goal_met`, server work O-series) render as gold milestone cards, pinned 30 minutes, first in Pulse Highlights, marked on Reps today / Team, and as an 8-second toast from `components/daily/milestone-toast.tsx` mounted in the shell. The rest of this paragraph is the DOP-10/11 history. Category panels plus complementary Arrivals, New York-day counts, pace, live BFF. DOP-01–11 shipped; Arrivals is a live rail on the board. **DOP-10:** tiles + panel headers show `%` vs yesterday-by-now plus a visible yesterday / day-before line; Hourly rhythm chart; Quiet priorities / Sheet Sync / Colours in the chrome toolbar; every event kind has a colour tone with Owner overrides in `localStorage` (`vantage-admin-daily-kind-colors`); cards show every stored fact. **DOP-11:** `?lane=` is a solo Panel view (All panels clears it; replaces expand-in-place); full-stream overlay; enter/exit motion; like-hour baselines follow the browser clock; count per `event` (`metrics` ignored by the board); 5-min / hidden ≥ 240s / day-rollover snapshot resync; per-lane Load earlier; `lanesNeedingBackfill` includes `exception` (a panel count must not sit above an empty stack). Live `/` is Today (`components/today/`): Pulse (Waiting for you, five tiles, Hourly rhythm, Highlights, Reps today, By source company), Operations (this board, `embedded`), Team, Money. `HomeOverview` is retired. Daily Operations is category panels plus complementary Arrivals, not Daily View, not Live Events, not a 24h/48h tabbed layout, not a sitemap, not a second Analytics. Confirm is not on `/daily`. Do not invent from `uxdocs/admin-operational-views-ux-proposal.md` or `uxdocs/owner-daily-view-planned.txt`. Contract: `vantage-main-server/docs/daily-operations/daily-operations-specification.md`. Pointer: `vantage-main-server/docs/knowledge/services/daily-operations.md`. Pack: `vantage-main-server/docs/daily-operations/`.

**Later contract (not implemented):** [`vantage-main-server/docs/granot-lead-lifecycle/release-into-booking-intake-specification.md`](../../../vantage-main-server/docs/granot-lead-lifecycle/release-into-booking-intake-specification.md) retires the cancellation intake tab. Rows below still describe the shipped Booking/Cancellation `/intakes` surface. Do not invent replacement UI from this map.

## Architecture Map

| Area | Owns |
|------|------|
| `app/(auth)/` | Owner login (`/login`) |
| `app/(dashboard)/` | Protected dashboard pages + layouts |
| `app/(public)/` | Public surfaces (`/employee-booking`) |
| `app/api/auth/` | Local admin session handlers only |
| `app/api/proxy/[...path]/` | Authenticated BFF → `vantage-main-server` (JSON/CSV; buffers the body) |
| `app/api/daily-operations-live/` | Owner-only SSE BFF that pipes `GET /api/v1/admin/daily-operations/live` without buffering |
| `app/api/employee-booking/` | Public options/submit (feature-flagged; not dashboard auth) |
| `proxy.ts` | Next 16 request-boundary auth (not `middleware.ts`) |
