## Auth & Proxy

- `proxy.ts` → cookie presence check → redirect to `/login`. Dashboard layout re-verifies JWT.
- Public: `/login`, `/api/*`, `/employee-booking`, legal pages, static assets.
- **Owner-only pages:** `/` Today (Owner all tabs; a Manager gets Operations only; Admin is sent to `/leads`), `/bookings/reconciliation`, `/intakes` (Bookings → To finish), `/leads/timeline` (typed Job Number owner chain; `/job-timeline` redirects), `/outreach-desk` (also Manager and Rep; never generic Admin), `/setup/connections` and `/setup/website` (Owner-only Setup sections; other roles see the Not allowed card), `/automations/**` (Automations: Granot updates, doc 17; `/ingestion/granot` and `?run=` redirect there; the case/discrepancy URLs under `/ingestion/granot/lifecycle` remain),`/granot-lifecycle/**`. Exception: `/granot-lifecycle/health` is Owner/Admin because the server health GET is Owner/Admin. Admin cannot open Today (a Manager can, Operations only); `/granot-lifecycle` and `/granot-lifecycle/receipts` only redirect to Health. `/settings` is not owner-only: Admin can hit the permanent redirect and land on Setup → Carriers (Admin-readable).
- Proxy flow: require admin session → validate relative path → `canProxyVantagePath(role, method, path)` → strip browser `x-api-secret`/`authorization`/`cookie` → set `x-vantage-admin-{user-id,email,role}` (+ optional HMAC via `VANTAGE_ADMIN_PROXY_SIGNING_SECRET`) → `server/vantage-api/client.ts` attaches `x-api-secret`.
- Non-owners: blocked from Daily Operations (`GET/POST /api/v1/admin/daily-operations*` and `/api/daily-operations-live`), reconciliation, Granot automation, Granot lifecycle **pages** (except Health) / candidates / creating-observation / Booking commands / any non-GET lifecycle call, Connect Booking to Lead (`GET/POST /api/v1/admin/bookings/:bookingId/connect-lead*`), Google Drive, reporting mutations (GET reporting OK), registry mutations (some read-preview POSTs OK), DELETE, Owner `POST /api/v1/admin/sheet-sync/contains` and `POST /api/v1/admin/sheet-sync/retry`, Extension User list/create (`GET/POST /api/v1/admin/extension-users`). Allowed: operational PATCH on Form/Call Leads, Bookings and Cancellations (not Customers), the operational create POSTs, and standard Granot lifecycle **GET** (cases/jobs/health, not candidates or creating-observation). Health GET stays Admin-readable. The proxy and the login/logout/refresh handlers write no audit rows (SLIM-08).
- Never expose `VANTAGE_API_SECRET` or signing secrets to client / `NEXT_PUBLIC_*`.

